@startuml rag-pipeline
' The end-to-end RAG data path: index-time ingestion (documents → embeddings →
' index) meeting query-time retrieval (query → embedding → top-k → results) at
' the shared RagIndex. Colour encodes role, per the repo-wide legend in
' architecture.puml:
'   #2E7D32 green  = embeddings / neural     #6A1B9A purple = retrieval
'   #00838F teal   = storage / persistence   #455A64 grey   = I/O boundary
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/rag-pipeline.puml
' Source of truth for Figure 1 in docs/components/rag/overview.md §3.
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam rectangle {
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  BorderColor #263238
  roundCorner 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowFontColor #37474F
title RAG — index-time ingestion ⇄ query-time retrieval

legend top right
  |= Colour |= Role |
  |<#2E7D32>     | Embeddings / neural (ModernBERT) |
  |<#6A1B9A>     | Retrieval (backend, scoring, ranking) |
  |<#00838F>     | Storage / persistence |
  |<#455A64>     | I/O boundary |
endlegend

' ─────────────────────────── index time ───────────────────────────
rectangle "**Corpus**\n.txt · .md · .html\nor DocumentBuilder values" as corpus #455A64

rectangle "**IndexBuilder** / **ParallelIndexBuilder**\nscan → process_builder → add_document" as builder #6A1B9A

rectangle "**ModernBertEmbedder**\nembed_document(title, content)\ntext ↦ v ∈ ℝ⁷⁶⁸" as embedder #2E7D32
rectangle "**Summarizer**\ncreate_synopsis(explicit, content)\nexplicit ⊳ MMR-extractive fallback" as summarizer #2E7D32

rectangle "**Document**\nid · uri · title · synopsis\nlanguage · embedding · metadata" as doc #6A1B9A

' ─────────────────────────── the index ───────────────────────────
rectangle "**RagIndex<B>**\nbackend: B ⊕ documents: HashMap<DocumentId, DocumentMeta>\ntopic_model: Option<TopicModel>" as index #00838F

rectangle "**RetrievalBackend** (B)\nunit-normalised embeddings\nExactCosineBackend │ HnswBackend" as backend #6A1B9A

rectangle "**On disk**\nbackend/ · metadata.json\nconfig.json · state.json · topic_model.json" as disk #00838F

' ─────────────────────────── query time ───────────────────────────
rectangle "**Query**\n“what is dense retrieval?”" as query #455A64
rectangle "**Retriever<B>**\nembed → search → filter → rank" as retriever #6A1B9A
rectangle "**ModernBertEmbedder**\nembed_query(q)\nq ↦ v_q ∈ ℝ⁷⁶⁸" as qembed #2E7D32
rectangle "**Top-k by cosine**\nargmax₍k₎ ⟨v̂_q , v̂_d⟩" as topk #6A1B9A
rectangle "**Filter + rank**\nscore ≥ min_similarity\nsynopsis-kind gates" as filter #6A1B9A
rectangle "**Vec<RetrievalResult>**\nuri · title · synopsis · score · rank" as results #455A64

' ─────────────────────────── edges ───────────────────────────
corpus --> builder : scan_directory
builder --> embedder : content
builder --> summarizer : content
embedder --> doc : v ∈ ℝ⁷⁶⁸
summarizer --> doc : Synopsis
doc --> index : add_document
index --> backend : add(id, v)\n(normalise to ‖v̂‖₂ = 1)
index <--> disk : save / load

query --> retriever
retriever --> qembed
qembed --> topk : v_q
backend --> topk : v̂_d  ∀d
topk --> filter : Vec<(DocumentMeta, score)>
filter --> results

note bottom of backend
  Embeddings are stored **pre-normalised**,
  so cosine similarity degenerates to a
  plain dot product — one BLAS ""sgemv""
  for the whole corpus.
end note

note bottom of index
  The index owns the //metadata//; the backend
  owns the //geometry//. A result is emitted only
  when **both** agree the document exists.
end note
@enduml
